<title>USA: Baby Superstore Inc Q2 net loss vs profit.</title>
<headline>Baby Superstore Inc Q2 net loss vs profit.</headline>
<dateline>DUNCAN, S.C. 1996-08-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr loss		   $0.61   profit	 $0.15</p>
<p> Net loss		  11,688   profit	 3,009</p>
<p> Revs		     102,554		   64,532</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  19,235		   19,716</p>
<p>	  6 MONTHS</p>
